### Create report
POST http://localhost:3000/reports/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "make": "ford",
    "model": "mustang",
    "year": 2001,
    "mileage": 25000,
    "lng": 0,
    "lat": 0,
    "price": 15000
}

### Get all reports
GET http://localhost:3000/reports

### Approved existing report
PATCH http://localhost:3000/reports/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "approved": true
}

### Get an estimate for vehicle
GET http://localhost:3000/reports/estimate?make=ford&model=mustang&lng=0&lat=0&mileage=25000&year=2002

